{"id":"6fc9389f17c0d108","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-kappa-distributive-poset.md","title":"ZFC Kappa Distributive Poset","display":"df-zfc-kappa-distributive-poset — ZFC Kappa Distributive Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-kappa-distributive-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-kappa-distributive-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-kappa-distributive-poset — ZFC Kappa Distributive Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-kappa-distributive-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-kappa-distributive-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-kappa-distributive-poset — ZFC Kappa Distributive Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b683d32b4fafc184\" href=\"?note=b683d32b4fafc184\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set\">58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\mathcal D\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\mathcal D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S\\)</span> (dense-open-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b683d32b4fafc184\" href=\"?note=b683d32b4fafc184\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set\">58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaDistributivePoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaDistributivePoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaDistributivePoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\Bigl((|\\mathcal D|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(q\\in D))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaDistributivePoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\Bigl((|\\mathcal D|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(q\\in D))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The intersection of every family of fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> dense open subsets is dense; parentheses fix the former ambiguous implication scope.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"b683d32b4fafc184","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[58-df-poset]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"b683d32b4fafc184","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S$ (dense-open-set predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\mathcal D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaDistributivePoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaDistributivePoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\forall\\mathcal D\\;\\Bigl((|\\mathcal D|<\\kappa\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(q\\in D))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1539,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2397","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-